17. Drugs that may cause significant weight gain have been used or are being used within 3 months before screening, including tricyclic antidepressants, atypical antipsychotics and mood stabilizers (e.g., midazolam, amitriptyline, mirtazapine, paroxetine, phenyl valproic acid and its derivatives and lithium), etc;
