* Active pulmonary infection and/or acute bacterial or fungal infection requiring intravenous antibiotic treatment within 28 days;
* Dominant jaundice due to abnormal liver function within 7 days;
* Renal insufficiency: routine urinalproteinuria \> 2+ and confirmed 24 h urinary protein quantification \> 1.0g;
